er presence (Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode) for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every signature with a holder key: to present a credential,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and to sign the Credential Request’s jwt proofs, so receiving","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and refreshing credentials ask too — once per copy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), or once per Credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Request when its jwt proof carries a key attestation, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again if the issuer refuses the nonce — and a refresh can’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"run without the holder. The Secure Enclave","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enforces it. Off, the app asks for it itself (with","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LAContext.evaluatePolicy"},{"type":"text","text":") before every presentation — in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the app, from a link, through a document provider extension,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and in person — a check the app’s own code keeps, not the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key. For Face ID, the app’s Info.plist must have an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":"; without one, iOS asks for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passcode instead. A presentation answering several documents"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at once ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/respond(answers:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(answers:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") asks once: its holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keys share one authentication context for that call only."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/holderuserpresence","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"holderUserPresence"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderUserPresence","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Options","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Options","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"KeychainKeyStore.Options","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"How the store makes and keeps keys.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Keychai